{"4765620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bunkerhold", "steam_appid": 4765620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome To Bunkerhold.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your partner operate a checkpoint where every visitor must be inspected before they are allowed inside. <strong>Your job is to decide who can be trusted - and who can't.</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INSPECT EVERY VISITOR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check documents, review records, question new arrivals, and use specialized scanners. Look closely - <strong>some visitors are not who they claim to be.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765620/extras/be172e040627cee0be5bc6d4d9c1c263.poster.avif?t=1787262261\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765620/extras/be172e040627cee0be5bc6d4d9c1c263.webm?t=1787262261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765620/extras/be172e040627cee0be5bc6d4d9c1c263.mp4?t=1787262261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAKE THE DECISION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won't always agree. Share your findings, discuss your suspicions, and cast your votes. <strong>When the decision is made, there's no turning back.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765620/extras/cf8d0fb96a8846a70e7ebe252a722e51.poster.avif?t=1787262261\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765620/extras/cf8d0fb96a8846a70e7ebe252a722e51.webm?t=1787262261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765620/extras/cf8d0fb96a8846a70e7ebe252a722e51.mp4?t=1787262261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROTECT THE BUNKER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Not every visitor will accept your decision. When someone or something tries to force its way inside, <strong>follow emergency protocols, seal the checkpoint, and do whatever it takes to protect the people inside.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765620/extras/cc7b85e30bf93831f9a41ac17626b96d.poster.avif?t=1787262261\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765620/extras/cc7b85e30bf93831f9a41ac17626b96d.webm?t=1787262261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765620/extras/cc7b85e30bf93831f9a41ac17626b96d.mp4?t=1787262261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome To Bunkerhold.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your partner operate a checkpoint where every visitor must be inspected before they are allowed inside. <strong>Your job is to decide who can be trusted - and who can't.</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INSPECT EVERY VISITOR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check documents, review records, question new arrivals, and use specialized scanners. Look closely - <strong>some visitors are not who they claim to be.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765620/extras/be172e040627cee0be5bc6d4d9c1c263.poster.avif?t=1787262261\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765620/extras/be172e040627cee0be5bc6d4d9c1c263.webm?t=1787262261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765620/extras/be172e040627cee0be5bc6d4d9c1c263.mp4?t=1787262261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAKE THE DECISION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won't always agree. Share your findings, discuss your suspicions, and cast your votes. <strong>When the decision is made, there's no turning back.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765620/extras/cf8d0fb96a8846a70e7ebe252a722e51.poster.avif?t=1787262261\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765620/extras/cf8d0fb96a8846a70e7ebe252a722e51.webm?t=1787262261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765620/extras/cf8d0fb96a8846a70e7ebe252a722e51.mp4?t=1787262261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROTECT THE BUNKER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Not every visitor will accept your decision. When someone or something tries to force its way inside, <strong>follow emergency protocols, seal the checkpoint, and do whatever it takes to protect the people inside.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765620/extras/cc7b85e30bf93831f9a41ac17626b96d.poster.avif?t=1787262261\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765620/extras/cc7b85e30bf93831f9a41ac17626b96d.webm?t=1787262261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765620/extras/cc7b85e30bf93831f9a41ac17626b96d.mp4?t=1787262261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Bunkerhold is a 1–2 player cooperative psychological horror game. You and a friend work at an underground bunker checkpoint, inspecting visitors, questioning suspicious strangers, using scanners, and deciding who gets inside. Some visitors are not who they claim to be.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Polish, Turkish, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765620/470074480ca0613ba14c4db10b14331d02bf7c6a/header.jpg?t=1787262261", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765620/e5d9c17d7db864656667d34f4d683d29a6d1a38b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787262261", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765620/e5d9c17d7db864656667d34f4d683d29a6d1a38b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787262261", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6 GB / AMD Radeon RX 580 8 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available spac